  - m_Id: 2040774160457
    m_Localized: Tactical Manual (Mage)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160456
    m_Localized: Earthquake Magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160455
    m_Localized: Area Expansion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160454
    m_Localized: Tactical Manual (Archer)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160453
    m_Localized: Rain of Arrows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160452
    m_Localized: Magic Bow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160451
    m_Localized: Tactical Manual (Warrior)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160450
    m_Localized: Healing Factor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160449
    m_Localized: Ancient Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160448
    m_Localized: Spayne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160447
    m_Localized: Alice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160446
    m_Localized: Noah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160445
    m_Localized: Serah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262176796672
    m_Localized: Narration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128320
    m_Localized: Fortress Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128321
    m_Localized: Demian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128322
    m_Localized: Commander
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128323
    m_Localized: System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322624
    m_Localized: In front of the gate of Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322625
    m_Localized: Is this Cies Defense Fortress? I heard monsters hardly ever show
      up here, and it really is quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322626
    m_Localized: Are you the Commander and the Guardians?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322627
    m_Localized: Welcome to Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322628
    m_Localized: Thanks for the welcome. Sorry to ask about work as soon as we arrive,
      but could you show us around?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322629
    m_Localized: This is Serah, and this is Noah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322630
    m_Localized: Nice to meet you! I'm Serah, and I handle the front line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322631
    m_Localized: I'm Noah. I'll keep an eye on movement from a distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322632
    m_Localized: And these are Alice and Spayne.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322633
    m_Localized: I'm Alice. I handle signal stone inspections and magical support.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322634
    m_Localized: I'm Spayne. I handle healing. Tell me right away if you're hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322635
    m_Localized: I'm Demian, captain of the Cies fortress guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322636
    m_Localized: Looking forward to working with you, Demian. We were briefed on
      which areas to inspect before we arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322637
    m_Localized: Serah, check the gate checkpoint. Noah, watch the forest path from
      the watchtower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322638
    m_Localized: Alice, check the signal stones, and Spayne, could you inspect the
      supply depot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322639
    m_Localized: Demian, could you assign a guide to each of the four of them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322640
    m_Localized: Understood. I'll assign escorts immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322641
    m_Localized: All right! I'll check the gate first. I'll let you know right away
      if anything happens!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322642
    m_Localized: Going ahead is fine, but don't get too far ahead on your own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322643
    m_Localized: I'll check the signal stones first. Once I'm done, I'll come check
      the gate too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322644
    m_Localized: The supply depot inside the gate... Isn't that the farthest place
      from here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322645
    m_Localized: Serah, want to switch jobs with me...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322646
    m_Localized: Sorry. I'll take the gate. Holding the front is my job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322647
    m_Localized: I'd like to argue... but you're right, which makes me want to go
      even less...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322648
    m_Localized: Reporting! A large group of monsters is approaching the gate from
      the forest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322649
    m_Localized: Serah... didn't you say it was quiet?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322650
    m_Localized: I did! So we'll just make it quiet again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322651
    m_Localized: She's not wrong, so why does that sound so ominous?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322652
    m_Localized: Noah, keep watch on the forest path from the watchtower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322653
    m_Localized: Spayne, bring the first-aid supplies from the supply depot. Join
      us at the gate as soon as both of you are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322654
    m_Localized: Okay. I'll check it and head over right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322655
    m_Localized: Ugh... I came all the way to the farthest place, and now I have
      to turn right back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322656
    m_Localized: Serah and Alice, hold off the monsters at the gate checkpoint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322657
    m_Localized: All right! I'll take the front of the gate. I won't let a single
      one through!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322658
    m_Localized: That's reassuring, but wait for the signal before you move. I'll
      handle whichever side they crowd toward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322659
    m_Localized: Got it. I'll move as soon as the signal comes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322660
    m_Localized: The monsters have reached the gate! Commander, please prepare the
      signal stones!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322661
    m_Localized: I'll signal Serah and Alice first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322662
    m_Localized: Signal link confirmed. Serah, ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322663
    m_Localized: All right, here I go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322664
    m_Localized: They're starting to swarm in! I'll hold the front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322665
    m_Localized: Got it. I'll clear out the side they're crowding toward first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322666
    m_Localized: I see the second wave. I'm joining you now. I'll keep watch on movement
      farther out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322667
    m_Localized: All right! Noah can handle the distant enemies, and I'll hold the
      front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322668
    m_Localized: I checked the lock on the supply depot. Brought the bandages too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322669
    m_Localized: Now I can treat anyone who gets hurt right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322670
    m_Localized: I see a big one. This group is moving around it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322671
    m_Localized: Then we stop the big one first. I'll take it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322672
    m_Localized: Serah, wait! If this drags on, even more monsters will gather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322673
    m_Localized: Commander, send Serah the skill signal!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322674
    m_Localized: It's the ultimate signal. It'll use the entire gauge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322675
    m_Localized: Signal received! I'll hit it with everything I've got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322676
    m_Localized: Is anyone hurt? Don't push yourself. Tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322677
    m_Localized: I'm not hurt! The gate wall looks a little scraped up, though...
      It'll be fine, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322678
    m_Localized: We can't just leave it at "it'll be fine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322679
    m_Localized: Still, you did a good job stopping them in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322680
    m_Localized: Let's check the wall now too. It'll be a bigger hassle to repair
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322681
    m_Localized: But something's strange. That whole group came down the forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322682
    m_Localized: I saw it from the watchtower too. I don't think the movement deeper
      along the forest path has stopped yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322683
    m_Localized: Then we'll need to check the forest path again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322684
    m_Localized: Cies isn't normally a place where monsters swarm like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322685
    m_Localized: So much for this being a quiet post. That rumor was completely wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322686
    m_Localized: Serah was the first one to tell us that rumor, remember?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322687
    m_Localized: Then I'll check for myself and set the record straight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322688
    m_Localized: Wait. I see something in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322689
    m_Localized: There's something glowing where the monsters passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322690
    m_Localized: You're right. It doesn't look like an ordinary stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322691
    m_Localized: If we touch it carelessly, this could get even more complicated.
      Let's inspect it first...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322692
    m_Localized: Alice, could you take a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322693
    m_Localized: Yeah. It doesn't seem to be reacting dangerously.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322694
    m_Localized: The reaction is similar to a signal stone's, but not quite the same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711232
    m_Localized: This is a relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711233
    m_Localized: Then we'd better choose carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711234
    m_Localized: Then let's pick something that will help Serah hold the front longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711235
    m_Localized: Visibility is poor on the forest path. If Serah can hold the front,
      it'll be easier for everyone else to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711236
    m_Localized: Selected. This effect will stay with us from now on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711237
    m_Localized: Let's check the forest path first. Noah, see which way the tracks
      lead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711238
    m_Localized: Okay. The tracks are still there. I'll see where they lead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711239
    m_Localized: I'll check the signal stones again. I need to tune them before the
      next group arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711240
    m_Localized: All right! Let's find the cause and make Cies quiet again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711241
    m_Localized: So... we really have to go now. We won't have to go too far, right...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711242
    m_Localized: Please tell me we don't have to go...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711243
    m_Localized: In front of the gate of Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711244
    m_Localized: Commander, Guardians.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711245
    m_Localized: I'll compile the defense records from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711246
    m_Localized: Thanks, Demian.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711247
    m_Localized: Let's check everyone's condition before we head out to the forest
      path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711248
    m_Localized: Yeah. No one seems badly hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711249
    m_Localized: It's good that no one was seriously injured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711250
    m_Localized: If treatment takes too long, it'll wear everyone out...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711251
    m_Localized: If treatment drags on, Spayne will have it the hardest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711252
    m_Localized: Still, everyone's safe. That's what matters!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711253
    m_Localized: We can stop the next one the same way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711254
    m_Localized: Before we rely on momentum alone, let's check the signal stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711255
    m_Localized: I reviewed the record from our first battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711256
    m_Localized: The signal the Commander sent is still stable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711257
    m_Localized: Can we keep that effect going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711258
    m_Localized: We can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299390316544
    m_Localized: We can strengthen one person's signal and make our battles more
      stable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065280
    m_Localized: It'd be good if we can prepare before heading out to the forest
      path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065281
    m_Localized: Then we just have to choose what we'll need from now on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065282
    m_Localized: I'm in favor of anything that keeps things from becoming a bigger
      problem later...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065283
    m_Localized: Commander, choose how we should tune it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065284
    m_Localized: It's tuned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065285
    m_Localized: This enhancement will stay with us from now on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065286
    m_Localized: Great! No matter who we choose, it'll help us later!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065287
    m_Localized: I'll make sure the selected signal carries properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065288
    m_Localized: Then we're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065289
    m_Localized: We should probably go before it gets any later...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065290
    m_Localized: There is still movement along the forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065291
    m_Localized: Please be careful if you venture far from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065292
    m_Localized: Understood. We won't go too far from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065293
    m_Localized: Everyone ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065294
    m_Localized: Yeah! I'm ready to head out anytime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065295
    m_Localized: Yeah. Let's recheck the tracks and sounds as we go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065296
    m_Localized: All right. Let's work our way out from the area closest to the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065297
    m_Localized: I just hope it's not a path that'll take us forever to come back
      from...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065298
    m_Localized: Entrance to the forest path in front of the Cies gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065299
    m_Localized: Let's start here. We won't be going too far from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065300
    m_Localized: Yeah. The tracks we saw in front of the gate lead all the way here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065301
    m_Localized: If we follow them a little farther, I think we'll see where they
      came down from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065302
    m_Localized: Got it. If anything dangerous appears, I'll stop it at the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065303
    m_Localized: All right. Let's examine the tracks first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065304
    m_Localized: Let's first find out where they came down from toward the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065305
    m_Localized: Then I'll start leaving markers here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065306
    m_Localized: If we get lost here, our break time will disappear too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065307
    m_Localized: That would definitely be a disaster!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065308
    m_Localized: Losing our way back would be the bigger disaster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065309
    m_Localized: They're both important...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065310
    m_Localized: Maybe it's because we're on a forest path, but the air is damp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065311
    m_Localized: The dirt is soft, and the sunlight is nicely blocked...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065312
    m_Localized: If you're about to say it makes you sleepy, hold out a little longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065313
    m_Localized: I hadn't said it yet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065314
    m_Localized: Right. And you just said "yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065315
    m_Localized: Wait. The grass beside the path is flattened in one direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065316
    m_Localized: Which way does it lead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065317
    m_Localized: The tracks lead from deeper in the forest toward the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065318
    m_Localized: There must've been quite a few. The tracks overlap all over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065319
    m_Localized: Ngh...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065320
    m_Localized: Noah?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065321
    m_Localized: Sorry. I just got a little startled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065322
    m_Localized: That sound just came from the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065323
    m_Localized: Got it. If anything moves in the brush, I'll stop it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065324
    m_Localized: Serah, don't get too far ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065325
    m_Localized: Stay where Noah can keep track of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065326
    m_Localized: Got it. I won't go too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065327
    m_Localized: Yeah... Just as I thought, these don't look like tracks from something
      deliberately heading for the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065328
    m_Localized: There are lots of skid marks and almost no signs that they stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065329
    m_Localized: It looks like the monsters fled down from deeper in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065330
    m_Localized: Then does that mean something is chasing them from deeper in the
      forest?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065331
    m_Localized: We don't know yet. But it doesn't look like they came this way by
      choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065332
    m_Localized: They weren't moving with the gate as their target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065333
    m_Localized: It's more likely they came down here fleeing from something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065334
    m_Localized: Commander, monster footsteps are approaching from deeper in the
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065335
    m_Localized: They're coming straight down along the same route as the tracks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065336
    m_Localized: If we fall back now, they may make it all the way to the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453888
    m_Localized: All right. Let's stop them here before they reach the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453889
    m_Localized: Got it! I'll stop them first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453890
    m_Localized: All right. I'll clear out whichever side they crowd toward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453891
    m_Localized: Ugh... I don't like fighting on paths like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453892
    m_Localized: Still, stopping them here is better than falling back to the gate...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453893
    m_Localized: Is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453894
    m_Localized: Tell me right away if anything hurts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453895
    m_Localized: If you keep quiet and endure it, it'll only hurt more...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453896
    m_Localized: And I'll have more work to do...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453897
    m_Localized: I'm fine! I'm not hurt anywhere!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453898
    m_Localized: It was definitely easier when I stopped them where Noah told me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453899
    m_Localized: I'll count on you next time, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453900
    m_Localized: Yeah. I won't miss anything either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453901
    m_Localized: I'm fine too. How about you, Spayne?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453902
    m_Localized: Yeah, me too. The forest path was just a little uncomfortable...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453903
    m_Localized: That's a relief. Let's talk through the details after we return
      to the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453904
    m_Localized: For now, getting out safely comes first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453905
    m_Localized: I'm glad everyone's okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453906
    m_Localized: We'll check farther inside later. For now, let's head back to the
      gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453907
    m_Localized: Yeah. That sounds best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453908
    m_Localized: Spayne, can you still see the markers you left earlier?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453909
    m_Localized: Yeah. I can see the cloth I tied, and our footprints are still there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453910
    m_Localized: Commander, I have an additional report.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453911
    m_Localized: The scout sent to inspect the southern approach has returned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453912
    m_Localized: They report finding similar tracks on the southern approach as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453913
    m_Localized: Tracks alone aren't enough to be certain, but the area appears to
      warrant investigation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453914
    m_Localized: Then this isn't limited to the forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453915
    m_Localized: Yeah. They may be part of the same trail we saw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453916
    m_Localized: Understood. Let's include that in the report.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453917
    m_Localized: Once we're ready, let's go inspect the southern approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453918
    m_Localized: Entrance to the southern approach of Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453919
    m_Localized: Is this the southern approach the scout mentioned?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453920
    m_Localized: Yes, this is the place. The path runs just below the gate to the
      south.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453921
    m_Localized: I can see the tracks the scout mentioned, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453922
    m_Localized: Their depth and spacing are similar to the tracks we saw on the
      forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453923
    m_Localized: So the group that came down the forest path also split off toward
      the southern approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453924
    m_Localized: This path doesn't look very suitable for moving the wounded...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453925
    m_Localized: If we go any farther in, it'll be harder to respond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453926
    m_Localized: Let's not go too deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453927
    m_Localized: Let's check the entrance and stop them here if it's dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453928
    m_Localized: Got it. I'll watch deeper inside the southern approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453929
    m_Localized: The tracks get deeper here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453930
    m_Localized: They're pressed much deeper than the ones we saw on the forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453931
    m_Localized: It looks like they rushed down without even having time to look
      around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453932
    m_Localized: Then we need to stop them before they reach the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453933
    m_Localized: Yeah. There are many places where the tracks overlap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453934
    m_Localized: They don't form a single line. Some twist off to the side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648192
    m_Localized: Then the monsters didn't simply pass through the southern approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648193
    m_Localized: If we're pushed back on a path like this, moving the wounded will
      be difficult...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648194
    m_Localized: Then we just stop them here before they can push us back, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648195
    m_Localized: Easier said than done...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648196
    m_Localized: Wait. There's movement inside the brush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648197
    m_Localized: Which direction is it coming from?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648198
    m_Localized: From deeper inside the southern approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648199
    m_Localized: Just like on the forest path, they're being driven down from farther
      in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648200
    m_Localized: If any get past us here, we'll have even more wounded at the gate...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648201
    m_Localized: If we're pushed back here, they'll have a straight path to the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648202
    m_Localized: Then I'll take the front of the approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648203
    m_Localized: Commander, the monster group will come into view soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648204
    m_Localized: They're coming straight down the path. We just need to block the
      front of the approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648205
    m_Localized: All right. Let's stop them here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648206
    m_Localized: If Serah holds the front, I'll clear whichever side they crowd toward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648207
    m_Localized: I'll leave the rear to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648208
    m_Localized: Please try to keep the injuries to a minimum...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648209
    m_Localized: I'll keep watching. I'll tell you immediately if you get too far
      ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648210
    m_Localized: Is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648211
    m_Localized: Is anyone hurt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648212
    m_Localized: I'm fine! I'm not hurt anywhere!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648213
    m_Localized: Blocking them on a narrow path wasn't as bad as I expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648214
    m_Localized: I'm fine too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648215
    m_Localized: You know that was pretty close, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648216
    m_Localized: But we kept them from reaching the gate, didn't we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648217
    m_Localized: That's true... but be a little more careful next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648218
    m_Localized: Yeah, me too... I'm just glad no one got hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648219
    m_Localized: I don't want to stay here long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648220
    m_Localized: Wait. The tracks haven't ended yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648221
    m_Localized: The tracks on the southern approach continue toward the gate's defensive
      wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648222
    m_Localized: Then the tracks from both paths converge in front of the gate's
      defensive wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648223
    m_Localized: Yeah. We need to check the area in front of the wall too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648224
    m_Localized: All right. Next time, let's follow Noah's findings first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648225
    m_Localized: Yeah. I'll keep watching where the tracks lead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648226
    m_Localized: It's good that we're starting to work better together...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648227
    m_Localized: So why does that keep pushing our break farther away...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648228
    m_Localized: Let's stop our inspection of the southern approach here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648229
    m_Localized: Let's return to the front of the gate's defensive wall and check
      its condition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648230
    m_Localized: In front of the gate's defensive wall at Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901911920640
    m_Localized: Guardians, is everyone safe?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669376
    m_Localized: Yeah. We inspected the southern approach too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669377
    m_Localized: The tracks from the southern approach meet the ones from the forest
      path here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669378
    m_Localized: Yes. The tracks are concentrated in front of the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669379
    m_Localized: Are there any signs that the monsters stopped?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669380
    m_Localized: Yeah. There are more skid marks than signs that they stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669381
    m_Localized: So the tracks of monsters driven down this way piled up all the
      way to the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669382
    m_Localized: Then if we're pushed back here, we'd be forced straight back to
      the gate...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669383
    m_Localized: Then I'll take the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669384
    m_Localized: This time, the gate is right behind us. Don't go too far ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669385
    m_Localized: Got it. I'll stop them where you can still see me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669386
    m_Localized: Movement from the forest is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669387
    m_Localized: They're coming down from the forest path and the southern approach
      at the same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669388
    m_Localized: I'll pull the soldiers back behind the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669389
    m_Localized: While you hold them off, we'll inspect the condition of the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669390
    m_Localized: All right. Let's defend the gate here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669391
    m_Localized: Got it. I won't let the monsters get past the front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669392
    m_Localized: Tell me right away if you're hurt. Hiding it will only make things
      harder...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669393
    m_Localized: Is anyone hurt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669394
    m_Localized: I'm fine! We held the front of the gate too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669395
    m_Localized: Still, we need to check the condition of the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669396
    m_Localized: Even if it looks intact outside, the inside may be different...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669397
    m_Localized: Demian, how is the wall?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669398
    m_Localized: It's holding, but it has taken quite a few impacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669399
    m_Localized: It'll be difficult to stop the next group immediately in this condition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669400
    m_Localized: Then it needs reinforcement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669401
    m_Localized: Yes. It would be safer to patch it up, even if only briefly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669402
    m_Localized: There is still movement in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669403
    m_Localized: I can hear heavier footsteps mixed in than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669404
    m_Localized: Then let's repair the wall first and investigate the heavier movement
      from the forest again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669405
    m_Localized: If we have time for maintenance, maybe I can close my eyes for a
      moment...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669406
    m_Localized: Sleeping isn't included in maintenance time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669407
    m_Localized: I hadn't finished speaking yet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669408
    m_Localized: ...Well, that was almost exactly what I was going to say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057984
    m_Localized: All right. Let's repair the gate's defensive wall first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057985
    m_Localized: Noah and Alice, keep monitoring movement in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057986
    m_Localized: Serah and Spayne, inspect the areas that need repair with the soldiers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057987
    m_Localized: Yeah. I'll keep watching the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057988
    m_Localized: All right! I'll have everything ready before we move to the central
      defensive line!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057989
    m_Localized: All right. This time, let's try to keep both the people and the
      wall from getting hurt...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057990
    m_Localized: In front of the gate's defensive wall at Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057991
    m_Localized: Demian, I think this area is badly cracked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057992
    m_Localized: Yes. I'll reinforce it immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057993
    m_Localized: We should fix it now... If the crack widens, we'll have to look
      after both the people and the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057994
    m_Localized: We can't repair it completely, but it can withstand one more incoming
      group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057995
    m_Localized: That's enough. Our priority is reinforcing it so it doesn't collapse
      while we stop the incoming group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057996
    m_Localized: All right. Let's reinforce the weak points first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057997
    m_Localized: Yeah. Let's try to leave ourselves fewer repairs for later...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057998
    m_Localized: The wall reinforcement is complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057999
    m_Localized: The signal stones can still be tuned one more time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058000
    m_Localized: Once chosen, this enhancement will stay with us. Let's choose carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058001
    m_Localized: All right. Let's tune them one last time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058002
    m_Localized: We can't take long. The movement from the forest is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058003
    m_Localized: Then all the more reason to choose something we won't regret...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058004
    m_Localized: It's tuned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058005
    m_Localized: Now let's check the situation in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058006
    m_Localized: Commander, the movement deeper in the forest is strange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058007
    m_Localized: One set of footsteps is noticeably heavier than the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058008
    m_Localized: The surrounding monsters are being swept up in that movement and
      driven down too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058009
    m_Localized: We still don't know whether it's leading the group or being driven
      this way like the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058010
    m_Localized: What we do know is that the large monster is the greatest threat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058011
    m_Localized: Let's stop them at the central defensive line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058012
    m_Localized: We need to stop that thing while the reinforced wall holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058013
    m_Localized: Got it. Let's finish this in front of the wall!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058014
    m_Localized: If we end up with even more wounded, I'll be really busy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058015
    m_Localized: If everyone's ready, let's move now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058016
    m_Localized: So there really is no rest until the very end...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058017
    m_Localized: Waiting will only make it harder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058018
    m_Localized: Serah stole my reasoning...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058019
    m_Localized: Central defensive line of Cies Defense Fortress, ahead of the gate's
      defensive wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058020
    m_Localized: Commander, those are the heavy footsteps we heard earlier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058021
    m_Localized: I still can't see it, but it's getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058022
    m_Localized: The surrounding monsters are being driven down ahead of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058023
    m_Localized: We don't have time to investigate further. We have to stop them
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058024
    m_Localized: All right. Let's finish this before they reach the wall!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058025
    m_Localized: Then please try to keep the number of wounded down...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058026
    m_Localized: The large movement is still deeper in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058027
    m_Localized: We need to stop the group coming down first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058028
    m_Localized: The reinforced wall can hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058029
    m_Localized: But it will not hold for long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058030
    m_Localized: I'll have the soldiers stand by behind the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058031
    m_Localized: The signal stone tuning is holding too. We just can't let this drag
      on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058032
    m_Localized: All right. Let's stop them at the central defensive line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058033
    m_Localized: Yeah. Let's defend Cies right here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058034
    m_Localized: Tell me right away if you're hurt. Hiding it will only make things
      harder...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058035
    m_Localized: That first group is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058036
    m_Localized: It looks like they'll reach the central defensive line soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058037
    m_Localized: The surrounding monsters are scattering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058038
    m_Localized: It looks like fewer of them are being driven this way now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058039
    m_Localized: Phew... That was really close this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058040
    m_Localized: Good... We stopped them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058041
    m_Localized: We defended Cies Defense Fortress!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058042
    m_Localized: Let's check for injuries first... We can celebrate afterward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058043
    m_Localized: The soldiers are safe. No one is seriously injured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058044
    m_Localized: The gate's defensive wall held as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058045
    m_Localized: Without the Guardians, we would not have been able to hold the line
      in front of the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058046
    m_Localized: We haven't resolved the problem completely, but we stopped the group
      that came today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058047
    m_Localized: Yeah. That's enough for now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058048
    m_Localized: Good work, everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058049
    m_Localized: Commander, we received a report from Zeppel during the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058050
    m_Localized: They say monsters are also converging in one direction at Zeppel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058051
    m_Localized: The same report has been sent to high command.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058052
    m_Localized: I'll hand over the defense of Cies as soon as reinforcements arrive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058053
    m_Localized: Then the same phenomenon is happening in Zeppel too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058054
    m_Localized: It may be separate from the decrease in monster movement at Cies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058055
    m_Localized: The cause is still out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058056
    m_Localized: Still, keeping Cies safe is a clear success.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058057
    m_Localized: Yeah. Let's check Zeppel before it's too late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058058
    m_Localized: I think our break just moved even farther away...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058059
    m_Localized: We need to prepare to move first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058060
    m_Localized: All right... I'll believe our break is moving with us...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058061
    m_Localized: All right. Let's wrap things up at Cies and head straight to Zeppel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252288
    m_Localized: In front of Zeppel's outer gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252289
    m_Localized: Are you the Guardians from Cies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252290
    m_Localized: That's right. We're here to check the situation in Zeppel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252291
    m_Localized: Yes. Groups of monsters keep coming down the outer road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252292
    m_Localized: We are evacuating the residents inside the gate, but some supply
      carts are still outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252293
    m_Localized: The tracks all lead in a single direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252294
    m_Localized: Just like at Cies, this group was driven in one direction instead
      of choosing its own course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252295
    m_Localized: All right. Let's stop them here. We need to protect the people inside
      while they evacuate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252296
    m_Localized: Right. The wide road may make it a little easier to hold them off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252297
    m_Localized: But if we're pushed back even once, people will be hurt immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252298
    m_Localized: If someone gets hurt in a crowded place, even finding them is a
      job in itself...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252299
    m_Localized: So if possible, please keep my workload small.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252300
    m_Localized: Once the carts are through, we can clear the area in front of the
      gate immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252301
    m_Localized: Please hold the defensive line until then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252302
    m_Localized: Understood. Let's clear the area in front of the gate first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252303
    m_Localized: Open a path for the carts and keep the defensive line where it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252304
    m_Localized: Understood. We'll begin immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252305
    m_Localized: Commander, there are many tracks on the road outside the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252306
    m_Localized: If any monsters stray onto the side road, they'll run straight into
      the route the carts are using.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252307
    m_Localized: Then we can't push too far forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252308
    m_Localized: Let's hold this line until the carts are through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252309
    m_Localized: All right. I'll take the side they hit first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252310
    m_Localized: I won't let the monsters take a single step toward the carts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252311
    m_Localized: Yeah. I'll watch for any movement breaking off to the side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252312
    m_Localized: Serah, just don't get too far ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252313
    m_Localized: Got it. I'll stop them within this line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252314
    m_Localized: I'm happier if you stay inside the defensive line too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252315
    m_Localized: If you go too far, I'll have to come looking for you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252316
    m_Localized: The group outside the gate is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252317
    m_Localized: They're coming straight in along the outer road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252318
    m_Localized: Monster group approaching! They're directly ahead of the outer gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252319
    m_Localized: All right. Keep the route for the carts open, and stop the incoming
      group at the outer gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252320
    m_Localized: Yeah. I'll take the front of the gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252321
    m_Localized: I'll keep watching movement outside. I'll tell you immediately if
      any stray onto the side road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252322
    m_Localized: I'll clear them out if they crowd toward one side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252323
    m_Localized: Tell me right away if you're hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252324
    m_Localized: If you endure it in silence, it'll be hard on both you and me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252325
    m_Localized: Is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252326
    m_Localized: It doesn't look like any of the residents are badly hurt either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252327
    m_Localized: Great! The carts made it inside safely too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252328
    m_Localized: We protected the people inside Zeppel!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252329
    m_Localized: Yeah. But the monsters are still coming down the same road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252330
    m_Localized: We only stopped them at the gate. Their movement hasn't stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252331
    m_Localized: If they keep coming down...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252332
    m_Localized: Does that mean we won't get to rest early today either...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252333
    m_Localized: Some of the tracks in front of the gate split off to the side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252334
    m_Localized: I can see tracks leading toward the farming district too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252335
    m_Localized: Understood. Let's investigate the trail that split off first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252336
    m_Localized: Yeah. We only stopped part of the group at the outer gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252337
    m_Localized: We need to see where the rest went.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252338
    m_Localized: Commander, we have also received a report from the farming district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252339
    m_Localized: They say monsters are pushing through the fences.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446592
    m_Localized: They've reached the farms too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446593
    m_Localized: Then they've gone even farther into an area where people live.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446594
    m_Localized: Yeah. The tracks that split off in front of the gate led toward
      the farming district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446595
    m_Localized: Judging by the report, they're already deep inside the farms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446596
    m_Localized: The field paths will be muddy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446597
    m_Localized: If I fall, I'll spend more time washing up than resting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446598
    m_Localized: This isn't the time to calculate your break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446599
    m_Localized: Don't underestimate the importance of rest...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446600
    m_Localized: Let's move to the temporary command post first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446601
    m_Localized: Before we go to the farms, let's compile the records from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446602
    m_Localized: Yeah. I'll check the signal stone response too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446603
    m_Localized: Let's find out which road the tracks split onto.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446604
    m_Localized: All right. As soon as we're done, let's head straight to the farms!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446605
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Gate Front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446606
    m_Localized: First Joint Maintenance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446607
    m_Localized: Forest Path in Front of Cies Gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446608
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Southern Entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446609
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Gate Wall Front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446610
    m_Localized: Gate Wall Maintenance Before the Boss Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640896
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Central Defense Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160528
    m_Localized: Wave 1 ready. Place signal stones to strengthen heroes before battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640897
    m_Localized: Drag the attack signal stone to Serah's slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640898
    m_Localized: COMBO +1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640899
    m_Localized: The combo extended the remaining Sort time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640900
    m_Localized: Setup complete. Press BATTLE START to begin combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640901
    m_Localized: Level Up! Select the reward you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640902
    m_Localized: Tap a reward card once to select it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640903
    m_Localized: Tap the selected card once more to confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640904
    m_Localized: Gained Attack +8 from [Sharp Senses]!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640905
    m_Localized: Noah joins. Ranged support ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640906
    m_Localized: Spayne joins. All heroes ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640907
    m_Localized: Noah and Spayne join!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640908
    m_Localized: A large monster appeared. Prepare Serah's skill signal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640909
    m_Localized: 'Tap a portrait to use an ultimate.<br>Serah: frontal area attack
      / Noah: increased attack speed / Alice: area magic attack / Spayne: heals all
      allies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640910
    m_Localized: Tap Serah's portrait to use her ultimate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640911
    m_Localized: Ultimate activated!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640912
    m_Localized: Touch the screen during the cutscene to show the Skip button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640913
    m_Localized: Stage Clear! Check your rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640914
    m_Localized: Relic effects carry over to the next stage. Choose 1 of 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640915
    m_Localized: Tap the selected relic once more to confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640916
    m_Localized: Ancient Armor acquired. The selected relic has been registered in
      your owned list. Its effect remains in later stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
